{"html_text": {"ja253:0.1": "<article id='ja253'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja253:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja253:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja253:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja253:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja253:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja253:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja253:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja253:4.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja253:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja253:0.2": "Tikanipāta ", "ja253:0.3": "Saṅkappavagga ", "ja253:0.4": "3. Maṇikaṇṭhajātaka ", "ja253:1.1": "“Mamannapānaṁ vipulaṁ uḷāraṁ, ", "ja253:1.2": "Uppajjatīmassa maṇissa hetu; ", "ja253:1.3": "Taṁ te na dassaṁ atiyācakosi, ", "ja253:1.4": "Na cāpi te assamamāgamissaṁ. ", "ja253:2.1": "Susū yathā sakkharadhotapāṇī, ", "ja253:2.2": "Tāsesi maṁ selaṁ yācamāno; ", "ja253:2.3": "Taṁ te na dassaṁ atiyācakosi, ", "ja253:2.4": "Na cāpi te assamamāgamissaṁ”. ", "ja253:3.1": "“Na taṁ yāce yassa piyaṁ jigīse, ", "ja253:3.2": "Desso hoti atiyācanāya; ", "ja253:3.3": "Nāgo maṇiṁ yācito brāhmaṇena, ", "ja253:3.4": "Adassanaṁyeva tadajjhagamā”ti. ", "ja253:4.1": "Maṇikaṇṭhajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja253:0.1": "", "ja253:0.2": "", "ja253:0.3": "", "ja253:0.4": "", "ja253:1.1": "", "ja253:1.2": "", "ja253:1.3": "", "ja253:1.4": "", "ja253:2.1": "", "ja253:2.2": "", "ja253:2.3": "", "ja253:2.4": "", "ja253:3.1": "jigīse → jigiṁse (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja253:3.2": "", "ja253:3.3": "", "ja25